  "prefLabel": "Lab 207.05 Role of Board Staff in Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 207.05 Role of Board Staff in Hearings. Board staff shall have no role in misconduct hearings unless called as a witness by a party to the hearing.\n\nSource. #14534, eff 3-12-26",
